The Atlas engine is fetched at build time from Enntity/atlas, a fork of
Atlas-Inf/atlas, at the commit in install/atlas-source.json (AGPL-3.0-only).

CUTLASS (BSD-3-Clause) is fetched at build time. The image ships its notice
and the notices of the engine's Rust dependencies under /opt/atlas/notices/.

start.sh and install/ are adapted from SparkQwen and SparkGLM (AGPL-3.0-only,
the same contributors).

Inkling 2 Mini, including its bundled DSpark draft model, is by Thinking
Machines Lab, Inc., licensed under Apache-2.0; its weights are downloaded at
install time (thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini) and are not part of this
repository. Spark mode also downloads Enntity/Inkling-2-Mini-Spark-NVFP4, an
NVFP4 quantization derived from those weights (Apache-2.0). The default
drafter, incoai/Inkling-2-Mini-DFlash2, is by Inco AI (Apache-2.0) and is
downloaded at install time.

docs/assets/make_cards.py sets text in Press Start 2P by CodeMan38 (SIL Open
Font License 1.1); the font is not included in this repository.
